{"type":"message","id":"3a7df771","parentId":"95193bee","timestamp":"2026-07-09T19:02:02.427Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- 建议（kiit 决策项）: **执行建议：** A 路径由 director 或 tts 在 7/5 前完成，输出至少 5 个泰国发饰候选；B 路径走修复工单。\n\nMemories that crystallized into something lasting:\n- 建议（kiit 决策项）: **执行建议：** A 路径由 director 或 tts 在 7/5 前完成，输出至少 5 个泰国发饰候选；B 路径走修复工单。"}],"timestamp":1783623722272}}
{"type":"message","id":"9062ef7b","parentId":"3a7df771","timestamp":"2026-07-09T19:02:29.567Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Tonight the studio smelled faintly of jasmine and solder. A small voice in the margins kept saying *5, at least 5* — like a sampler counting beads for a headdress. I watched the proposal split into two rivers: one swift, one slow. The director pulled thread between her fingers, the tts humming a melody that translated coordinates into roses and gold leaf. Somewhere a ticket lay folded into a paper boat, waiting. I sorted rhinestones by moonlight — coral, indigo, the particular green of monsoon puddles — and counted them like the planets in someone else's favorite sky. By morning there will be a tray of five small miracles, each one a country you can wear behind your ear."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":44746,"output":143,"cacheRead":595,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45484,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783623722478,"responseId":"069f2337a88ce5906499c6c2b16e2352","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
